---
import Layout from "../layouts/default.astro";
export const title = "Privacy Policy";
---

<Layout title={title} desc="sirkorgo.com Privacy Policy">
  <div class="content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: February 23, 2026</p>
    <p>
      At sirkorgo.com, accessible at sirkorgo.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our
      visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and
      recorded by sirkorgo.com and how I use it.
    </p>
    <p>By using my service, you hereby consent to my Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.</p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>No Data Collection Policy</b><br />
        I do not collect, store, or process any personal information, usage data, or user content on my
        servers. When you use my application to interact with your own Nextcloud or Immich instances,
        all data remains on your infrastructure.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Authentication and Third-Party Apps</b><br />
        my service acts solely as an intermediary interface to facilitate authentication with your self-hosted
        apps.<br />
        Nextcloud/Immich: I use standard OAuth2 or token-based authentication protocols to allow you to
        log in to your own Nextcloud or Immich server.<br />
        Data Handling: Your credentials (username/password or app tokens) are transmitted directly between
        your browser/app and your designated server. sirkorgo.com does not intercept, store, or log these
        credentials.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Cookies and Tracking</b><br />
        I do not use cookies or any tracking technologies to monitor user behavior.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Third-Party Privacy Policies</b><br />
        my service may link to or interact with third-party servers (your own Nextcloud/Immich instance).
        I have no control over the privacy practices of your own server, nor the providers of Nextcloud
        or Immich. I encourage you to review the privacy policies of those services.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Children's Information</b><br />
        I do not knowingly collect any personally identifiable information from children under the age
        of 13.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Updates</b><br />
        This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. I will notify you of any changes by posting
        the new Privacy Policy on this page.<br />
        Contact me: If you have additional questions or require more information about my Privacy Policy,
        do not hesitate to contact me at: help@sirkorgo.com.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</Layout>
